  "zh": "# AI 模型性价比提升，房贷新政落地，安全与中美关系成热点\n## AI 与科技\n- **GPT 6.1 Sol 性价比 五倍**：性能接近 Astra 但成本仅五分之一，AI 应用门槛将大幅降低。\n- **Dots 永久在线 AI 代理**：提供持续在线的智能体，可自动执行重复任务，提升工作效率。\n- **文本分类 Jev 模型 新突破**：在多基准上超越传统 Bag‑of‑Words，提升 NLP 实用性。\n## 政策经济\n- **购房 国补 政策 实施**：首付比例下降，购房门槛进一步放宽，刺激房地产需求。\n- **房贷 贴息 政策 月供 减负**：新政可直接抵扣利息，月供平均降低约 15%。\n## 社会国际\n- **充电器 未拔 导致 家庭 火灾**：提醒用户离家前拔掉充电器，避免可怕的财产损失。\n- **中美关系 照片 见证 刻度**：三张图片记录了近期高层互动细节，反映关系微妙变化。",
  "en": "# AI models deliver better value, new mortgage policies take effect, safety issues and US‑China ties dominate headlines\n## AI & Tech\n- **GPT 6.1 Sol price‑performance fivefold improvement**：Near‑Astra capabilities at one‑fifth the cost, cutting barriers for AI deployment.\n- **Dots always‑on AI agents launched**：Persistent agents automate routine workflows, boosting productivity.\n- **Text classification Jev model outperforms BoW**：New Jev‑based model beats classic bag‑of‑words on several benchmarks, improving NLP accuracy.\n## Policy & Economy\n- **Home purchase subsidy policy implemented**：Down‑payment requirements lowered, stimulating housing demand.\n- **Mortgage interest subsidy reduces monthly payments**：Direct interest cuts lower average mortgage payments by about 15%.\n## Society & International\n- **Unplugged charger causes house fire**：Leaving chargers plugged in can ignite fires; a reminder to unplug when away.\n- **Photos reveal shifts in US‑China relations**：Three pictures capture recent diplomatic encounters, hinting at evolving ties."
